						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">*turns on some music and does the thread bump*<br /><br />I&#039;ve been doing the whole, new to the boards, browsing semi-stale threads shabang and thought I might drop a line in here. <br /><br />My first, and only guild has been the Fizzle Fiends. Family oriented and casual I was introduced into the guild by real life family and found an &#039;EQ family&#039; within the Fiends. They&#039;re some of the best folks you can find out there (ex. They put up with me <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />). I&#039;ve been playing EQ for about 7 months now and the best experiences I&#039;ve had have been with my fellow guildees. A great group of people, even those who&#039;ve moved on to bigger things or other games. We&#039;re still alive and kicking, small, but quality beats the heck out of quantity.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm37.gif" alt="cwm37" border="0" /></td>
